ithub.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/06/03/1125344/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ギガちゃん、もう声あてられないのかなぁ。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう少しやりたいなぁ。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふとね、15枚目の個別握手会のお知らせみてね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"部数と時間が変わったのかと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはどういう変わり方なのかなぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いこまふぁむの皆様は、嬉しいって思うのかなぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は正直アイドルらしい対応出来なくて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それは、直接みなさんと会える握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうを伝えたくて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"丁寧に言葉を返したくて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、そんなギャップがあって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は充分にみなさんが楽しめる握手会に出来るのかと不安です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、感謝の気持ちはたくさんありますからっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうぞよろしくお願い致します！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/06/03/1125344/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/06/03/1125344/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全然写真に写ってないけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近髪の毛ウェットにするの大好きなんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウェットにしたらオールバックにするのハマっているんだ(^-^)⭐️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、普通に事務的なお仕事の日は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オールバックヽ(・∀・)ノヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前髪が目にかからないっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウェット！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとモード系の服着たらさらにテンション上がるっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウェットにするワックスをこれでもかと買ってまする笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/06/03/1125344/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また稽古したいなぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガンちゃーん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと公開になってましたねっヽ(・∀・)ノヽ(・∀・)ノヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コープスパーティーBook of Shadows"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の予告動画っ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観られた方いるかなっ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこで発表になりました、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"欅坂46の石森虹花ちゃんが篠崎ひのえ役で出演します〜！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっと？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じ坂道シリーズが同じ作品に出演出来ました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難い事ですっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く言いたくてうじうじしていたのだよ(^-^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/06/03/1125344/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言う事で〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"虹花ちゃんとのツーショット！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうぞ、欅坂46のファンの皆様も公開楽しみにしていて下さいねっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46のファンの皆様も"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/06/03/1125344/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/06/03/1125344/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いこのんっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/06/03/1125344/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きすぎるのんちゃんっっっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとに、もやも